  [33m⚠[0m Fixed stream-collection robustness (H2 verdict from T-285-001):

1. parseStreamJsonLine: Added `assistant` complete-message event handling. Extracts joined text from message.content[].text blocks, returns as `assistantText` field (not `text`) to avoid double-yielding delta content.

2. ParsedStreamEvent: Added `assistantText?: string` field.

3. runTurn: Removed all-or-nothing `collected.length===0` gate. Now tracks `assistantText` separately; at done event reconciles using max-length: picks whichever of (delta-collected, resultText, assistantText) is longest as the authoritative text for parseDeckentToolCalls. Fallback yield uses `resultText || assistantText` when no deltas arrived (backward compat preserved).

4. DECKENT_AGENTIC_SYSTEM_PROMPT: Replaced 'AÇIKLAMA YAPMA — yalnızca tek satır' with 'kısa bir açıklamadan sonra şu etiketi (veya birden fazlasını) üret:' — softens the constraint per post-fix system-prompt alignment.

